('uk-saml-2018','legislation','Sanctions and Anti-Money Laundering Act 2018: framework for UK autonomous sanctions','Sanctions and Anti-Money Laundering Act 2018 (c. 13)',
'SAMLA provides the legal basis for the UK to make sanctions regulations after leaving the EU, including designation powers, licensing, court review and enforcement.',
'The Sanctions and Anti-Money Laundering Act 2018 received Royal Assent on 23 May 2018. It enables ministers to make sanctions regulations for specified purposes, provides designation criteria and procedures, ministerial review and court challenges (s.38), and allows creation of offences. Amendments by the Economic Crime (Transparency and Enforcement) Act 2022 removed the requirement for ministers to consider designations "appropriate" on an ongoing basis in certain cases and introduced strict civil liability for OFSI penalties.',
'The 2022 amendments are significant: OFSI may impose civil monetary penalties on a strict liability basis, removing the need to prove knowledge or reasonable cause to suspect.',
'ANALYSIS — Strict civil liability means firms cannot rely on lack of knowledge as a defence to OFSI penalties. Controls design should assume that any breach is potentially penalisable.',
'2018-05-23','2018-05-23','2018-05-23',(select id from jurisdictions where code='UK'),(select id from regimes where slug='multi'),(select id from authorities where slug='ofsi'),
'{}','{"All sectors"}','{"Sanctions and Anti-Money Laundering Act 2018","Economic Crime (Transparency and Enforcement) Act 2022"}',
'2018 c. 13',null,null,'in_force',null,'{}','{}','https://www.legislation.gov.uk/ukpga/2018/13/contents','legislation.gov.uk','verified',false,'{"SAMLA","strict liability","framework"}');

insert into public.record_categories (record_id, category_id)
select r.id, c.id from public.intelligence_records r join public.categories c on
 (r.slug in ('eu-14th-package-russia','eu-16th-package-russia') and c.slug in ('trade-restrictions','financial-services'))
 or (r.slug='eu-14th-package-russia' and c.slug='due-diligence')
 or (r.slug in ('cjeu-rosneft-c72-15','cjeu-neves-77-c351-22','uksc-shvidler') and c.slug='judicial-review')
 or (r.slug='uksc-shvidler' and c.slug='designations')
 or (r.slug in ('ofac-binance-2023','ofac-gva-capital-2024','ofsi-wise-2023','bis-seagate-2023') and c.slug='penalties')
 or (r.slug='ofac-binance-2023' and c.slug='crypto')
 or (r.slug='ofac-gva-capital-2024' and c.slug='ownership-control')
 or (r.slug in ('bis-seagate-2023','tri-seal-third-party-intermediaries') and c.slug='export-controls')
 or (r.slug in ('ofac-eo14114-ffi-guidance','tri-seal-third-party-intermediaries','eu-commission-edd-guidance','ofsi-wise-2023') and c.slug='due-diligence')
 or (r.slug='ofac-eo14114-ffi-guidance' and c.slug='financial-services')
 or (r.slug='uk-saml-2018' and c.slug in ('designations','penalties'));
